  <item>
    <title>100｜徒步他念他翁：6天5晚线路盘点和装备清单</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a75d8a5000a55a9bb047bda</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a75d8a5000a55a9bb047bda</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 11 Aug 2026 16:30:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>他念他翁下集，我们来聊聊有关这条线路的实用信息。除了六天五晚他念他翁看海线每一天的徒步路线和行程亮点，最后我们还聊了聊这次的装备清单，复盘了带对了的/带错了的/带少了的装备，如果你也有去他念他翁徒步的计划，希望这两集他念他翁的内容可以对你有帮助。</span></p><p><strong><span>我们的行程：</span></strong></p><p><strong><span>Day1 拉岗村——丁差措——一字泵营地（4300m）</span></strong><br><span>距离6.23km/爬升832下降25/耗时4h50m</span></p><p><strong><span>Day2 一字泵——</span></strong><span>加米措——</span><strong><span>龚拉垭口（4920m）——切坛牧场 （4349米）</span></strong><br><span>距离6.23km/爬升514下降550/耗时4H</span><br><br><strong><span>Day3 切坛—</span></strong><span>但马拉丁错——</span><strong><span>南加曲隆营 （4392）</span></strong><br><span>距离10.19/爬升337下降310/耗时4h33m</span></p><p><strong><span>Day4 南加曲隆牧场——</span></strong><span>南加拉垭口4920m——真拉垭口4950m——</span><strong><span>双湖营地（4715m）</span></strong><br><span>距离9.18km/776爬升476下降/耗时6小时</span></p><p><strong><span>Day5 双湖营地——地泵营地（4387m）</span></strong><br><span>距离5.19km/爬升113下降449/耗时2H</span></p><p><strong><span>Day6 揉措往返线</span></strong><br><span>距离8.9km/爬升630下降629/耗时5H</span></p><p><span>🌟想要加入山合作用听友群，可以wx搜索“shanhezuoyong”添加小助手，ta会把你拉进群聊。我们的小红书账号也是同名的「山合作用」，欢迎关注哦！</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgOxEW5kYd0nhXyF8Kajsz5iA1R3.JPG"><p><span>翻过第一个龚拉垭口（4920m）往切坛牧场走的路上</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FgiCBOjCuLMBW7NcrtJoxlLXKvf_.JPG"><p><span>万物有灵且美</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FpjbAiRzcSTU2cSGb5D69W6QcBP8.JPG"><p><span>很美的山和草甸</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ljJqSMbHHLzvrOoyKlAiaW2zyJI8.JPG"><p><span>从切坛牧场到南加曲隆营地会路过的但马拉丁错，阴天依然很美</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FkrBwbriG9yXXvOPO7UEDI3fom9A.JPG"><p><span>去揉搓的路上会看到另一个角度的大米勇雪山</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FnRZ8jBm_7Qlr2KkWvJAJY4izvQ7.JPG"><p><span>去往揉搓垭口的路，就像另一种魔戒之路</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lkSsL8pACu22sZ_2OHN-AfJOndbq.JPG"><p><span>站在揉搓垭口往回看，雪山一字排开</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgtT48Usy6rGgz93ABc21xHUD9kM.JPG"><p><span>垭口往下走20米，就能看到揉搓这梦幻的蓝</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln7opYe8JZ1tnjwnEmUd1i2gFUN9.JPG"><p><span>揉搓</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/loP0a44X4W1-hJoLNBvGVuQGok1A.JPG"><p><span>揉搓的孩子（也叫5号湖或者6号湖）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/ln2_ItLsjNpbg-C10SFgRyyKkJXB.JPG"><p><span>可爱的水母雪兔子（当地人叫雪莲）</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FsiiabwKZxeh7qmh8lBDZaZ1Gj7w.JPG"><p><span>美丽的绿绒蒿</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/lgTUgVaDE6ioMZVxvk4VOpaSFlfp.JPG"><p><span>尖被百合</span></p><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/Fig5T0T_fojzm0IaL1f-LHJq6L43.JPG"><p><span>国家二级保护植物 梭砂贝母</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong><br><span>Sophie、三三</span></p><p><strong><span>【内容导览】</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="59">00:00:59</a> 第一天：拉岗村——一字泵营地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="362">00:06:02</a> 第二天：一字泵营地——切坛牧场</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="669">00:11:09</a> 第三天：切坛牧场——南加曲隆营地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1090">00:18:10</a> 第四天：南加曲隆营地——双湖营地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1662">00:27:42</a> 第五天：双湖营地——地泵营地</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2624">00:43:44</a> 装备清单</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong><br><span>《Always Look On The Bright Side Of Life》（Monty Python）</span></p><p><strong><span>【录音指导】</span></strong><br><span>xhs@Cscissorhands</span></p><p></p><p></p><p></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6567f31194e9c96a60574b63/lrY1pWCHyds5mpIO0SzKe7uHM4JV.m4a" length="62118900" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:04:01</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdLnwQSYnjlatFg9Pn5Palz6_rb.jpg"/>
    <itunes:episode>100</itunes:episode>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>加更｜新手友好变深夜救援？亲历者复盘饮牛渠徒步被困事件</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/6a6f3a721b5e24969ce7aca2</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">6a6f3a721b5e24969ce7aca2</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 16:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>一次正常的京郊一日跟团徒步，变成了以深夜救援结束的24h历险经历。标注“新手友好”的线路结果变成荆棘开路和悬崖冒险……三三和Sophie邀请到朋友越越&amp;大成，作为7月25日“饮牛渠徒步被困事件”亲历者，一起复盘这起刚刚发生的46人深夜营救事件。</span></p><p><span>事件视频：xhs@大成进化论</span></p><p><span>录制场地：大小电波播客空间（麦子店）</span></p><p><strong><span>【本期主播】</span></strong><br><span>Sophie、三三、越越、大成</span></p><p><strong><span>【内容导览】</span></strong><br><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="0">00:00</a> 嘉宾介绍和事件梗概</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="540">09:00</a> 本次徒步路线的情况</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="900">15:00</a> 事情从这里开始有些不对劲</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1680">28:00</a> 终于决定呼叫救援</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2070">34:30</a> 消防员找到被困大部队</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2420">40:20</a> 想对徒步组织说</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2690">44:50</a> 营救结束后当晚组织者的应对方案</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2970">49:30</a> 后续，两波声明之后</span></p><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="3380">56:20</a> 以后还报徒步团吗？</span></p><p></p><p><strong><span>【本期音乐】</span></strong><br><span>《Tengeriin huch》（PSYKHON/Eilseg/Davanim）</span></p><p><strong><span>【录音指导】</span></strong><br><span>xhs@Cscissorhands</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/6567f31194e9c96a60574b63/lnHi42hxIcR7JsKDdqiQPo7s1cCO.m4a" length="59391312" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>01:01:08</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FtdLnwQSYnjlatFg9Pn5Palz6_rb.jpg"/>
